    {
      "subId": "46205",
      "subQuestName": "Solve the mystery (Go to Kaeya at the Knights of Favonius HQ for a hint)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4620501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4620501": {
            "id": "4620501",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}! You're back! Looks like you got the intel.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620502"
            ]
          },
          "4620502": {
            "id": "4620502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes and no. It's a lot more complicated than that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620503"
            ]
          },
          "4620503": {
            "id": "4620503",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Three six-armed giants reside in the city in the lake. Two guard the statue, one, the treasure.\" What do you make of it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620504"
            ]
          },
          "4620504": {
            "id": "4620504",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Riddles? How quaint. Let me think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620505"
            ]
          },
          "4620505": {
            "id": "4620505",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "\"City in the lake\" is clearly Mondstadt... As for the Six-Armed Giants... Hmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620506"
            ]
          },
          "4620506": {
            "id": "4620506",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Crabs?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620507"
            ]
          },
          "4620507": {
            "id": "4620507",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Giant crabs!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620508"
            ]
          },
          "4620508": {
            "id": "4620508",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Aside from asking just where we would find giant crabs...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620509"
            ]
          },
          "4620509": {
            "id": "4620509",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Crabs have eight legs, not six...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620516"
            ]
          },
          "4620516": {
            "id": "4620516",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The windmills, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620517"
            ]
          },
          "4620517": {
            "id": "4620517",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Should be... the windmills?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620518"
            ]
          },
          "4620518": {
            "id": "4620518",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Hey! That's smart!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620519"
            ]
          },
          "4620519": {
            "id": "4620519",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "A windmill has six blades... It fits.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620510"
            ]
          },
          "4620510": {
            "id": "4620510",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow! That makes sense!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620511"
            ]
          },
          "4620511": {
            "id": "4620511",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "So, out of the three windmills, two are close to the statue...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620512"
            ]
          },
          "4620512": {
            "id": "4620512",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "The other one is guarding...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620513"
            ]
          },
          "4620513": {
            "id": "4620513",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh! Ooh! This one Paimon knows! The treasure!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620514"
            ]
          },
          "4620514": {
            "id": "4620514",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Hehehe... Let's hope it's really that simple.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620515"
            ]
          },
          "4620515": {
            "id": "4620515",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Come on, {NICKNAME}! Let's go take a look around that windmill!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "46208",
      "subQuestName": "Look for the location in the riddle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4620801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4620801": {
            "id": "4620801",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "The location is in the Whispering Woods — you haven't forgotten, right?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "46206",
      "subQuestName": "Find the location of the buried treasure",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4620601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4620601": {
            "id": "4620601",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, to a genius like me, this is nothing. Take a look at this map!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "46207",
      "subQuestName": "Solve the mystery (Go to Kaeya at the Knights of Favonius HQ for a hint)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4620701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4620701": {
            "id": "4620701",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "\"She doesn't love him at all. The passion rushing through the clear spring is just a front. When she's cold and alone, her true heart is revealed.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620702"
            ]
          },
          "4620702": {
            "id": "4620702",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Any idea what that means?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620703"
            ]
          },
          "4620703": {
            "id": "4620703",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Is this some page stripped from a love novel that you just happened to find?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620704"
            ]
          },
          "4620704": {
            "id": "4620704",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, so it's not a clue. No wonder someone as clever as Paimon wasn't able to get it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620705"
            ]
          },
          "4620705": {
            "id": "4620705",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Hahaha... I'm just joking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620706"
            ]
          },
          "4620706": {
            "id": "4620706",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmph... Take this more seriously, Kaeya!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620707"
            ]
          },
          "4620707": {
            "id": "4620707",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Haha, this riddle is hard to figure out. Clear spring... Is it referring to Springvale?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620708"
            ]
          },
          "4620708": {
            "id": "4620708",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "\"Passion rushing through the clear spring...\" So when does passion rush through a clear spring?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620709"
            ]
          },
          "4620709": {
            "id": "4620709",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "And the \"heart\" of the waterfall must refer to the cliff on the left side of the waterfall. I noticed it once when I was out on patrol in the area.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620710"
            ]
          },
          "4620710": {
            "id": "4620710",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "The ending, \"cold and alone,\" probably has something to do with Cryo, which can be controlled by a Vision.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620711"
            ]
          },
          "4620711": {
            "id": "4620711",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "You should probably <color=#00E1FFFF>take someone who can manipulate Cryo with you</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620712"
            ]
          },
          "4620712": {
            "id": "4620712",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Thanks for the help, Kaeya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620713"
            ]
          },
          "4620713": {
            "id": "4620713",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "It's nothing. If a Knight of Favonius couldn't even answer a riddle, how could we be trusted to solve criminal mysteries?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620714"
            ]
          },
          "4620714": {
            "id": "4620714",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's go take a look in Springvale. We'll leave you to your \"criminal mysteries\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620715"
            ]
          },
          "4620715": {
            "id": "4620715",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Erm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4620716"
            ]
          },
          "4620716": {
            "id": "4620716",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "No, wait... Leave you to SOLVING your criminal mysteries!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "46209",
      "subQuestName": "Look for the location in the riddle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
