            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "If I'm right, the location described by the clue is the windmill the furthest away from the statue... I'm not completely certain though."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "46210",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
